# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Why this file exists
#
# The original plugin was a Paper plugin: Bukkit's entity API exposes
# Display/ArmorStand/TextDisplay setters that vanilla Minecraft keeps private
# (they are normally only reachable through NBT). This port has no Bukkit, so
# the handful of private vanilla members it genuinely needs are widened here
# instead of being re-implemented with reflection or fake wrappers.
#
# Every entry below was verified against Mojang-mapped sources
# (net/minecraft/world/entity/Display.java, ArmorStand.java) - names and
# descriptors are the real ones, not guesses.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

