# Wither Symbiote's Rampage burns 0.5 saturation every 10 ticks while it is
# sustained (Bukkit: player.setSaturation(player.getSaturation() - 0.5F)).
# FoodData only exposes a getter and addExhaustion(), which would drain four
# times slower than the original, so the field itself is widened instead.
